|","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਭੈ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰ ਚਲਾਉਾਂਦੇ ਸਨ"}}},{"verse_id":83060,"page_no":185,"line_no":83060,"gurmukhi":"ਸੁ ਮਾਰੁ ਮਾਰ ਉਚਾਰਹੀ ॥੩੬॥","translit_en":"s maar maar uchaarahee ||36||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"And striking their blows fearlessly, are shouting “kill, kill”.36."},"pu":{"ss":"ਅਤੇ ਮੂੰਹੋਂ 'ਮਾਰੋ' 'ਮਾਰੋ' ਬੋਲਦੇ ਸਨ ॥੩੬॥"}}},{"verse_id":83061,"page_no":185,"line_no":83061,"gurmukhi":"ਘਮੰਡ ਘੋਰ ਜਿਉ ਘਟਾ ॥","translit_en":"ghama(n)dd ghor jiau ghaTaa ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਸਾਵਣ ਦੀ ਘਨਘੋਰ ਘਟਾ ਵਾਗ"}}},{"verse_id":83062,"page_no":185,"line_no":83062,"gurmukhi":"ਚਲੇ ਬਨਾਹਿ ਤਿਉ ਥਟਾ ॥","translit_en":"chale banaeh tiau thaTaa ||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Preparing themselves like the thundering dark clouds, the brave fighters are marching forward."},"pu":{"ss":"(ਯੋਧੇ) ਠਾਠ ਬਣਾ ਕੇ ਚਲੇ ਸਨ।"}}},{"verse_id":83063,"page_no":185,"line_no":83063,"gurmukhi":"ਸੁ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਸੂਰ ਸੋਭਹੀ ॥","translit_en":"s sasatr soor sobhahee ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਸੂਰਮੇ ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰਾ ਨਾਲ ਸੋਭ ਰਹੇ ਸਨ।"}}},{"verse_id":83064,"page_no":185,"line_no":83064,"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਤਾ ਸੁਰਾਨ ਲੋਭਹੀ ॥੩੭॥","translit_en":"sutaa suraan lobhahee ||37||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Bedecked with weapons, they are looking so beautiful that the daughters of the gods are getting allured by them.37."},"pu":{"ss":"ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਦੇਵ-ਕੰਨਿਆਵਾ ਲੋਭਾਇਮਾਨ ਹੋ ਰਹੀਆਂ ਸਨ ॥੩੭॥"}}},{"verse_id":83065,"page_no":185,"line_no":83065,"gurmukhi":"ਸੁ ਬੀਰ ਬੀਨ ਕੈ ਬਰੈ ॥","translit_en":"s beer been kai barai ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਉਹ ਸੂਰਮਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਚੁਣ ਚੁਣ ਕੇ ਵਰ ਰਹੀਆਂ ਸਨ"}}},{"verse_id":83066,"page_no":185,"line_no":83066,"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਰੇਸ ਲੋਗਿ ਬਿਚਰੈ ॥","translit_en":"sures log bicharai ||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"They are very selective in wedding the warriors and all the heroes are moving about and looking impressive in the battlefield like Indra, the king of gods."},"pu":{"ss":"ਅਤੇ ਇੰਦਰ ਲੋਕ ਵਿਚ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਨਾਲ ਵਿਚਰਦੀਆਂ ਸਨ।"}}},{"verse_id":83067,"page_no":185,"line_no":83067,"gurmukhi":"ਸੁ ਤ੍ਰਾਸ ਭੂਪ ਜੇ ਭਜੇ ॥","translit_en":"s traas bhoop je bhaje ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਡਰ ਨਾਲ ਜਿਹੜੇ ਰਾਜੇ ਜੰਗ ਤੋਂ ਭਜ ਗਏ ਸਨ,"}}},{"verse_id":83068,"page_no":185,"line_no":83068,"gurmukhi":"ਸੁ ਦੇਵ ਪੁਤ੍ਰਕਾ ਤਜੇ ॥੩੮॥","translit_en":"s dhev putrakaa taje ||38||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"All those kings, who are frightened, they have been abandoned by the daughters of the gods.38."},"pu":{"ss":"ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ ਦੇਵ ਕੰਨਿਆਵਾ ਨੇ ਤਿਆਗ ਦਿੱਤਾ ਸੀ ॥੩੮॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":7849,"next":7851}}